{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2020-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1604793600, "end_date": 1605484799, "month_true_total": 1902, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:01:10 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "79333729", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121030853", "personaname": "Cyphur", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kTcP0hjMtNDC3217yfFHt2/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 138977, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 137743, "last_played": 1686125709, "avatar": "7904882166fd95d68aa426a26ccac7753ea0f82e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have sank over 2000 hours into this game and for years, I had enjoyed it. However, I strongly oppose the direction DE are taking. When I first played, it was a game to behold. I'd sink hours and hours each day into Warframe just out of pure enjoyment and fulfilment i'd get. As time went on, I enjoyed it less and less. Each update would push me further and further backwards pushing me to commit even more to a game i'd already had so much commitment to just to progress at a decent pace.\n\nThe more content DE add to the game, the harder they seem to lock it behind content and grind walls which took all the fun out of the game. All that money gone to waste, an investment with little to no return. I am thoroughly disappointed.", "timestamp_created": 1605484493, "timestamp_updated": 1605484493, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482150733470916748", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79333620", "author": {"steamid": "76561198149016462", "personaname": "BEEF", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/p